_4602098807981735916_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sMMpo30G4lUQ7kNvwH784X2&_nc_oc=AdopJFgDsc-xzjsRPHAHekM_CgaeVNTHCNYNGiUOFVUK61kbt5X0mNrIIhmMNGbtEzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQED-uZA1n_sVtwl9CmnyMG7_OM4VaN9uuXincIBjGV1NA&oe=6A858049"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "back Cover 2560.png", "id": "992462156201557", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820019_992462162868223_6141527655874204065_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fxy32iCRgGwQ7kNvwHOapgz&_nc_oc=AdpVjBUVrrolSP-6qsGKZrVs6XmEef1d74ZH9am95QvFZ4rKKf6vyvOIhF_o_9wzATo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGvK7UWwF_iT99EBvJnwzLESMCIppaZo1xJ-o3bcr5H6Q&oe=6A858C64"}, "display_name": "RaceFault VR  Car Racing", "keywords": ["vrracing", "cardriftvr", "simracingvr", "racefault", "vrcarracing"], "long_description": "**RaceFault VR Car Racing**  \nThe official RaceFault VR Car Racing experience - where every screeching turn feels real!  \n\n## \ud83d\udd25 KEY FEATURES  \n- **6 HIGH-OCTANE CARS**: Sports, muscle & off-road beasts  \n- **DUAL ENVIRONMENTS**: Neon City Circuit + Wild Forest  \n- **10+ CHALLENGING LEVELS**: Time trials, eliminations & championships  \n- **INTELLIGENT AI**: Adapts to your driving style  \n- **TRUE VR IMMERSION**: Feel every drift in 360\u00b0  \n\n**Meta Quest Optimized**: Haptic feedback, realistic physics & anti-motion sickness tech. Dominate leaderboards in **RaceFault VR Car Racing** - the most visceral VR racing sim!", "short_description": "Burn rubber in hyper-immersive VR! Race 6 customizable cars across city streets and wild forest tracks against relentless AI. 10+ heart-pounding levels of drifting chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/racefault/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_web